---
description: Dawaa platform core rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root — it is the source of truth for this project.

Key invariants:
- Every table has `tenant_id`; RLS on every tenant-scoped table
- No prescription auto-approval, no payment screenshot auto-approval, ever
- Stock is an append-only ledger — insert movements, never update quantities
- Money is `NUMERIC(14,4)` / `rust_decimal::Decimal` / string over the wire — never a float
- No raw SQL outside repository modules
- Never hand-write API types; they are generated from `contracts/openapi.json`

Work comes from numbered specs in `docs/`. One spec, one branch, one PR.
